  "prefLabel": "Jus 1505.04 Scope of Delegated Authority",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1505.04 Scope of Delegated Authority. The county attorney shall limit the scope of authority delegated to an assistant county attorney to the issuance of written demands for information related to an investigation of an offense under RSA 318-B or RSA 649-B.\n\nSource. #8082, eff 5-8-04",
